        <item>
            <title>OpenStill 0.0.4</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>What’s new in 0.0.4</h3><ul><li>HDR editing and display, HDR/HEIF export with gain maps, and HDR, panorama and focus-stack merges</li><li>Print, slideshows with video export, web galleries, and publishing to a folder, Flickr or SmugMug</li><li>People (face grouping and naming), a map with drag-to-place and GPX geotagging, a timeline, and tethered capture</li><li>Faster rendering and library opening, tested on a 50,000-photo catalog</li></ul>]]></description>
